  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to test replicable models to improve the quality of life of the poor and vulnerable groups affected by the rising costs in food prices and poverty in Yemen (especially women, youth, children), including the issue of environmental degradation, and poor health habits.</narrative>
  </description>
